html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> (<span class=\"fn\">t</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">B</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>         <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">u</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">B</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">a₀</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> (<span class=\"fn\">t</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">B</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">q</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>))</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Zimmermann's Karatsuba square root step, as in GMP's `mpn_dc_sqrtrem`: for `N = N' B² + a₁ B + a₀`\nwith `a₁, a₀ < B` and `B ≤ 2 s'`, where `s' = ⌊√N'⌋`, the quotient `q` and the remainder `u` of\n`(N' - s'²) B + a₁` by `2 s'` give `s = s' B + q` and `T = u B + a₀`, and then `⌊√N⌋` is `s` with\nthe remainder `T - q²` when `q² ≤ T`, and `s - 1` with the remainder `T + 2 s - 1 - q²` otherwise.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Sqrt.html#MPN.karatsuba_sqrt","kind":"theorem","line":71,"name":"MPN.karatsuba_sqrt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Generic/Sqrt.lean#L71-L144"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Sqrt.html#MPN.le_newton\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">le_newton</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">s </span><span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hx</span> : <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hs</span> : <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HDiv.hDiv\">/</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span>) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HDiv.hDiv\">/</a> <span class=\"fn\">2</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"One step of Newton's iteration stays at or above `s` when `s² ≤ N`, by AM-GM.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Sqrt.html#MPN.le_newton","kind":"theorem","line":47,"name":"MPN.le_newton","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Generic/Sqrt.lean#L47-L67"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Sqrt.html#MPN.le_sqrt_of\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">le_sqrt_of</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">x</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">N</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/Sqrt/Basic.html#Nat.sqrt\">sqrt</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`x ≤ ⌊√N⌋` when `x² ≤ N`.","docLink":"./MPN/Generic/Sqrt.html#MPN.le_sqrt_of","kind":"theorem","line":39,"name":"MPN.le_sqrt_of","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/862f63d87fc6e56d648eb33296f1cf7ff688fd89/MPN/Generic/Sqrt.lean#L39-L45"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Generic/Sqrt.html#MPN.eq_sqrt\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">eq_sqrt</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">r </span><span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h₁</span> : <span class=\"fn\">r</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">r</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">N</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h₂</span> : <span class=\"fn\">N</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> (<span class=\"fn\">r</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>) <a